      "end_seconds": 10.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.13,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.94,
      "end_seconds": 14.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 15.96,
      "end_seconds": 24.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening we came cos of irregular periods"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.75,
      "end_seconds": 29.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.7,
      "end_seconds": 52.43,
      "duration_seconds": 20.73,
      "text": "erm, it's been going on for two months. I've also been putting on weight, for about three months. And I've been feeling low as well. I did have spots on my face at one point, but that's gone now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.72,
      "end_seconds": 57.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "right, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.23,
      "end_seconds": 66.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "it's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.81,
      "end_seconds": 69.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.79,
      "end_seconds": 88.58,
      "duration_seconds": 18.79,
      "text": "for the anxiety, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take something called sert... sertraline, 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my mood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.67,
      "end_seconds": 94.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.05,
      "end_seconds": 104.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.58,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. It's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.65,
      "end_seconds": 110.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.27,
      "end_seconds": 121.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "I've had anxiety for nearly five years now. I have depression. I've had COPD, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.11,
      "end_seconds": 132.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Right, so anxiety is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. So, a few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.63,
      "end_seconds": 144.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I hardly move around during the day. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.15,
      "end_seconds": 149.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "So, have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.96,
      "end_seconds": 155.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.52,
      "end_seconds": 159.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.39,
      "end_seconds": 165.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.76,
      "end_seconds": 179.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pelvic pain, breast discharge or headaches with vision changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.06,
      "end_seconds": 186.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "No, no pelvic pain, breast discharge or headaches with vision changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.08,
      "end_seconds": 192.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any being pregnant or hot flushes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.59,
      "end_seconds": 199.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "no, you know, no being pregnant or hot flushes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.21,
      "end_seconds": 202.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "How about heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.29,
      "end_seconds": 206.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Nope, no heavy bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.55,
      "end_seconds": 211.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.58,
      "end_seconds": 216.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Let me think, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.32,
      "end_seconds": 222.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.63,
      "end_seconds": 225.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 227.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.28,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Oxygen saturation is 98 percent, pulse is 81 beats a minute, pressure 121 over 72, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.95,
      "end_seconds": 241.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "alright, good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.87,
      "end_seconds": 249.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.24,
      "end_seconds": 253.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.89,
      "end_seconds": 269.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "There is some acne on the face and extra hair on the chin, and your blood pressure is fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.13,
      "end_seconds": 277.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.34,
      "end_seconds": 318.59,
      "duration_seconds": 24.25,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? I don't have a clear answer today: a pattern that fits polycystic ovary syndrome is possible, and so is a thyroid problem we shouldn't forget raised prolactin so, to recap quickly you've had irregular periods for two months, and and no pelvic pain or heavy bleeding"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.68,
      "end_seconds": 322.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.07,
      "end_seconds": 326.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Any scans or blood work done already?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.09,
      "end_seconds": 336.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "I had a pelvic ultrasound done at another clinic a few months ago i don't have the report with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.73,
      "end_seconds": 352.3,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "Regular exercise and a small weight loss can make cycles more regular. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.03,
      "end_seconds": 354.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.4,
      "end_seconds": 358.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.84,
      "end_seconds": 364.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Okay, uh, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
